{
  "schema_version": 2,
  "family": "ScrollScrollbar2D",
  "scope": "Fifth scrolling group: the retained overlay scrollbar (one shared scrollbar_geometry calculation owned by incular-scroll for paint and input), the standalone RawScrollbar value (one shared geometry() owner for its paint and input), and the two-dimensional scroll engine. Paint-only controller mutations (style, thumb visibility) apply on the next viewport repaint; the revision bump is for reactive observation, not push invalidation. The &mut self viewport setters (physics, axis directions, main axis, cache, clip) are exercised behaviorally; the ledger tracks constructor inputs and fluent setters per its discovery rule. Wheel, draggable sheets, and physics internals belong to later groups; the existing advanced_scrolling suite covers their basics and is referenced, not duplicated. One controller across unrelated viewports stays a W5 gap. This ledger covers only this family; it does not claim whole-codebase completeness.",
  "allowed_phases": [
    "layout",
    "paint",
    "hit_test",
    "semantics",
    "reconciliation",
    "lowering",
    "conversion"
  ],
